## 🏷️ Available Annotations

This dataset includes rich annotations to support diverse learning approaches:

{% if eef_direction is defined or eef_velocity is defined or eef_acc_mag is defined -%}
### End-Effector Annotations
{% if eef_direction is defined -%}
- **Direction**: Movement direction classifications for robot end-effectors
{% endif -%}
{% if eef_velocity is defined -%}
- **Velocity**: Velocity magnitude categorizations during manipulation
{% endif -%}
{% if eef_acc_mag is defined -%}
- **Acceleration**: Acceleration magnitude classifications for motion analysis
{% endif -%}
{%- endif %}

{% if gripper_mode is defined or gripper_activity is defined -%}
### Gripper Annotations
{% if gripper_mode is defined -%}
- **Gripper Mode**: Open/close state annotations for gripper control
{% endif -%}
{% if gripper_activity is defined -%}
- **Gripper Activity**: Activity state classifications (active/inactive)
{% endif -%}
{%- endif %}

{% if features is defined -%}
